# Diagram Standards and Visual Conventions

## Standard Color Palette

Use these colors consistently across all diagrams:

```typescript
const DIAGRAM_COLORS = {
  // Layer-based colors
  frontend: '#e1f5fe',    // Light blue
  backend: '#f3e5f5',     // Light purple
  database: '#e8f5e8',    // Light green
  external: '#fff3e0',    // Light orange
  
  // State-based colors
  active: '#4caf50',      // Green
  inactive: '#9e9e9e',    // Gray
  error: '#f44336',       // Red
  warning: '#ff9800',     // Orange
  
  // Data flow colors
  request: '#2196f3',     // Blue
  response: '#4caf50',    // Green
  error_flow: '#f44336'   // Red
}
```

